; Regression test for issue #3280: alignment of the balance report with long
; commodity names.
; https://github.com/ledger/ledger/issues/3280
;
; The balance report's amount column is 20 characters wide by default, and
; every amount is right-aligned to it, including each line of a
; multi-commodity balance.  An amount wider than the column, such as
; "1 Veryveryverylongname" (22 characters), is printed in full and runs past
; the column's right edge on its own line.  The other lines of the same
; balance must stay on the column shared by the rest of the report.  The fix
; for #1795 had instead widened each balance to its own widest amount, which
; pushed its other lines two columns right of the same amounts on the other
; rows.

2023-01-01 * Property
    Assets:Property                       1 Veryveryverylongname
    Equity:Opening balance               -1 Veryveryverylongname

2023-01-01 * Property
    Assets:Property                       1 Shortername
    Equity:Opening balance               -1 Shortername

2023-01-01 * Bank
    Assets:Bank                           100.00 USD
    Equity:Opening balance               -100.00 USD

2023-01-01 * Rewards
    Assets:Rewards                        10000 Marriott
    Equity:Opening balance               -10000 Marriott

2023-01-02 * Antiques
    Collections:Antiques                  1 Aardvarkcollectibles
    Collections:Antiques                  10.00 USD
    Equity:Opening balance               -1 Aardvarkcollectibles
    Equity:Opening balance               -10.00 USD

test bal property
       1 Shortername
1 Veryveryverylongname  Assets:Property
end test

test bal assets
      10000 Marriott
       1 Shortername
          100.00 USD
1 Veryveryverylongname  Assets
          100.00 USD    Bank
       1 Shortername
1 Veryveryverylongname    Property
      10000 Marriott    Rewards
--------------------
      10000 Marriott
       1 Shortername
          100.00 USD
1 Veryveryverylongname
end test

; When the wide amount is not the last line of its balance, the account name
; that follows the last line stays aligned with the other rows' names as well.
test bal bank antiques
          100.00 USD  Assets:Bank
1 Aardvarkcollectibles
           10.00 USD  Collections:Antiques
--------------------
1 Aardvarkcollectibles
          110.00 USD
end test

; --amount-width widens the column for the whole report, so that every amount
; fits and all of them line up.
test bal assets --amount-width 22
        10000 Marriott
         1 Shortername
            100.00 USD
1 Veryveryverylongname  Assets
            100.00 USD    Bank
         1 Shortername
1 Veryveryverylongname    Property
        10000 Marriott    Rewards
----------------------
        10000 Marriott
         1 Shortername
            100.00 USD
1 Veryveryverylongname
end test
